==================================================================================
q=street.valueType==%22langString%22
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    "id": "urn:QM:E1",
q=street.valueType==http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns%23langString
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    "id": "urn:QM:E1",


