===========================
q=r.objectType==%22Building%22
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    "id": "urn:QM:E1",
q=r.objectType==%22House%22
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
q=t.unitCode==%22CEL%22
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    "id": "urn:QM:E1",
q=t.unitCode!=%22CEL%22
HTTP/1.1 200 OK


06. POST Query - the same q in a body
=====================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    "id": "urn:QM:E1",


07. Subscription S1 on type W, q=street.valueType=="langString"; restart; W1 (langString) notified, W2 (none) not
================================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
/vt urn:QM:S1 ['urn:QM:W1']


